  "requirement": "The `{term}` role followed by a backtick-delimited full definition name MUST reference a named definition. In rendered Markdown, the reference MUST display the definition's phrase as an ordinary hyperlink to its anchored declaration, without a badge. The phrase MUST be escaped appropriately for rendering.\n\nMissing targets and targets of another kind MUST be reported. Escaped references and references in Markdown code examples MUST remain literal. A term reference MUST NOT satisfy a requirement citation or a Rust function's requirement-coverage obligation.",
  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "The term role resolves only named definitions and renders an escaped phrase in a plain anchored link. Term references cannot count as Rust requirement citations. phrases_are_plain_links_and_markdown_literals_are_preserved checks linking, escaping and literals; function_attestations_capture_terms_without_counting_them_as_citations checks citation separation."
